{"title":"Royal Fir Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3\u003eA Premium Artificial Christmas Tree Built for Tradition\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eBring the warmth and grandeur of a traditional Christmas into your home with Royal Fir artificial Christmas trees from King of Christmas. Inspired by the stately Grand Fir, the Royal Fir is one of our most realistic and best-selling collections, celebrated for its exceptional mixed PE and PVC foliage, rich greenery, and full, lush silhouette.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eDesigned to create a welcoming holiday centerpiece, the Royal Fir features expertly crafted branches with lifelike detail and natural dimension that closely replicate the beauty of a freshly cut evergreen.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eAvailable in both full and slim silhouettes, the Royal Fir collection is designed to fit a variety of spaces — from spacious living rooms with room for a grand, sweeping tree to narrower layouts where a slim profile makes a more elegant fit.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhy choose the Royal Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe Royal Fir is the ideal choice for those who want the most realistic artificial Christmas tree that delivers the full, rich look of a freshly cut evergreen without any of the upkeep. \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eIts warm, traditional appearance makes it one of our most versatile and loved collections. Whether your holiday style is classic and layered or clean and understated, the Royal Fir provides a stunning, lifelike foundation that works beautifully with any décor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eIs the Royal Fir available pre-lit or unlit?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe Royal Fir collection is available in both pre-lit and unlit options to accommodate your decorating preferences.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eOur pre-lit Royal Fir artificial Christmas trees feature professionally installed LED lighting controlled by a simple remote. With the click of a button, you can switch seamlessly between warm white lights for a cozy glow and multicolor lights for a festive, vibrant display, giving you the flexibility to change the mood of your tree throughout the season without any rewiring or hassle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eWith Power Pole Technology, setup is effortless — no tangled cords, no complicated connections. Simply assemble, connect, and light up your tree instantly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhat decorating style works best with the Royal Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe Royal Fir's rich green foliage, full silhouette, and warm white \u0026amp; multi color lighting option make it an exceptionally versatile tree for a wide range of holiday decorating styles. It pairs beautifully with traditional red and gold palettes, warm white and natural wood accents, and heirloom ornament collections. Its fullness also makes it an excellent canvas for layered decorating with \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/ribbons\" title=\"Christmas Ribbons\"\u003eribbon\u003c\/a\u003e, garland, and multiple \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/christmas-ornaments\" title=\"Christmas Ornaments\"\u003eornament\u003c\/a\u003e styles all look stunning against its lush green backdrop.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eShould I choose the full or slim Royal Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe Royal Fir collection is available in both full and slim silhouettes to suit different spaces and decorating preferences.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe Royal Fir offers a wide, traditional Christmas tree shape with generous branch spread and a commanding, lush presence. Its fuller profile gives you ample room for ornaments, ribbon, and garland, making it ideal for larger living rooms, great rooms, or open spaces where you want a grand, realistic tree as your holiday focal point.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe Royal Fir Slim delivers the same premium mixed foliage and stunning LED lighting options in a narrower, more upright profile. It is an excellent option for apartments, smaller living rooms, entryways, or any space where a full-width tree feels too large.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eIs the Royal Fir easy to assemble and store?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eYes. The Royal Fir is designed for easy setup, long-term durability, and convenient after-season storage. Its hinged branch construction allows branches to fall naturally into place during assembly, creating a full and beautifully shaped tree with minimal effort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eEach tree includes a sturdy stand and complimentary setup gloves to help you shape and fluff the branches during assembly. A complimentary storage bag is also included to keep your tree protected between holiday seasons.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhen the season is over, the Royal Fir disassembles easily and should be store neatly in a cool, dry place, preserving its foliage, shape, and overall condition for many seasons to come.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"957\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eExplore the Royal Fir collection and find the size and silhouette that brings warmth, realism, and timeless holiday beauty into your home this season.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"6-5-foot-royal-fir-tree-led","title":"6.5' Royal Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 850 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642923741248,"sku":"RF-T6.5-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RoyalFir_20f68d8d-c632-40c6-9197-a0d56de53b1b.png?v=1722013184"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-royal-fir-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Royal Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642924003392,"sku":"RF-T7.5-U","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-8.jpg?v=1718158803"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-royal-fir-tree-led","title":"7.5' Royal Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 1000 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642924134464,"sku":"RF-T7.5-L","price":1199.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RoyalFir_187ca423-b95a-4973-81ad-b9b24bddb079.png?v=1722013181"},{"product_id":"9-foot-royal-fir-tree-led","title":"9' Royal Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 1200 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642924429376,"sku":"RF-T9-L","price":1699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RoyalFir_3795bea1-b24d-43e1-8cc9-89c11c4dcfc5.png?v=1722013200"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-royal-fir-slim-tree-unlit","title":"6.5' Royal Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Un